Commands/keys/IDs/units retain technical meaning in translation. Use real screenshots
matching language/version or explain differences. A generated future UI concept is not
an implementation screenshot; no Figma/media tool is required for a useful text guide.
Check content/revision links and the project's verified docs command; static success
is not translation quality or product acceptance.
